ord":"EXCEP","value":13,"type":"preposition"},{"word":"BUT","value":13,"type":"preposition"},{"word":"AND","value":2,"type":"conjunction"},{"word":"THEN","value":2,"type":"conjunction"},{"word":"IT","value":2,"type":"pronoun"},{"word":"THEM","value":2,"type":"pronoun"},{"word":"HIM","value":2,"type":"pronoun"},{"word":"HER","value":2,"type":"pronoun"}],"flags":[],"defines":[],"locations":[{"id":"intro","text":"DIBUJOS\n\nAn adventure written with Rocinante.\n","exits":[]},{"id":"start","text":"You are in an empty room. There is a door to the north.","exits":[{"word":"N","to":"corridor"}],"picture":"dib_entrada"},{"id":"corridor","text":"A long, dark corridor. The room is to the south.","exits":[{"word":"S","to":"start"}],"picture":"dib_pasillo"}],"objects":[{"id":"torch","text":"A torch.","noun":"TORCH","adj":"_","loc":"corridor","weight":1,"container":false,"wearable":false,"attrs":0}],"messages":[],"sysmsgs":["It's too dark to see anything.","I can also see:","\n","\n","\n","\n","I don't understand.\n","I can't go that way.\n","I can't do that.\n","I'm carrying:\n","I'm wearing:\n","","Are you sure? ","Would you like to play again? ","","OK.\n","Press any key.","","","","","","","I'm not wearing that.\n","I can't. I'm wearing the _.\n","I already have the _.\n","I can't see that here.\n","I can't carry any more.\n","I don't have that.\n","I'm already wearing the _.\n","Y","N","More...",">","","\nTime passes...","I take the _.\n","I'm now wearing the _.\n","I take off the _.\n","I drop the _.\n","I can't wear the _.\n","I can't take off the _.\n","I can't take off the _, my hands are full.\n","The _ is too heavy.\n","The _ is in the","The _ isn't in the",", "," and ",".\n","I don't have the _.\n","I'm not wearing the _.\n",".\n","There isn't one of those in the","Nothing.\n","T","D","Drive not ready. Press any key.","Read or write error.","The disc is full.","Invalid file name.","File name:","Start the tape.","Tape or disc?"],"processes":[{"id":"main","source":"; Main process. DAAD runs it at the start and comes back here on RESTART.\n; Describes the location (with its picture) and goes on to read commands.\n> _ _\n    AT intro               ; location 0 is the title screen\n    PROCESS init\n> _ _\n    WINDOW 0\n    CLEAR fDarkF\n    NOTZERO fDark          ; if flag 0 says it is dark...\n    ABSENT torch           ; ...and there is no light (object 0)\n    SET fDarkF\n> _ _\n    PICTURE @fPlayer       ; the location picture, if it has one\n    DISPLAY @fDarkF\n> _ _\n    WINDOW 1\n    NOTZERO fDarkF\n    SYSMESS 0\n> _ _\n    ZERO fDarkF\n    DESC @fPlayer\n> _ _\n    PROCESS after_describe\n> _ _\n    PROCESS turn\n"},{"id":"turn","source":"; One turn: read a phrase, count it and find what to do with it.\n> _ _\n    PROCESS each_turn\n> _ _\n    PARSE 0                ; if the phrase is not understood...\n    PROCESS not_understood\n    REDO\n> _ _\n    EQ fTurns 255\n    PLUS fTurnsHi 1\n    CLEAR fTurns\n    SKIP 1\n> _ _\n    PLUS fTurns 1\n> _ _\n    PROCESS responses\n    ISDONE                 ; if a response did something, next command\n    REDO\n> _ _\n    MOVE fPlayer           ; if not, maybe it is a movement\n    RESTART\n> _ _\n    NEWTEXT\n    LT fVerb 14\n    SYSMESS 7\n    REDO\n> _ _\n    SYSMESS 8\n    REDO\n"},{"id":"not_understood","source":"; The phrase was not understood (or the input timed out).\n> _ _\n    HASAT TIMEOUT\n    SYSMESS 35\n    DONE\n> _ _\n    SYSMESS 6\n"},{"id":"after_describe","source":"; After describing the location: the objects that are here.\n> _ _\n    NEWLINE\n    ZERO fDarkF\n    LISTOBJ\n"},{"id":"each_turn","source":"; Runs before every command: things that happen on their own go here.\n"},{"id":"responses","source":"; Responses to the player's commands. The most specific ones first.\n> I _\n    SYSMESS 9\n    LISTAT CARRIED\n    SYSMESS 10\n    LISTAT WORN\n    DONE\n> GET ALL\n    DOALL HERE\n> GET _\n    AUTOG\n    DONE\n> DROP ALL\n    DOALL CARRIED\n> DROP _\n    AUTOD\n    DONE\n> REMOV ALL\n    DOALL WORN\n> REMOV _\n    AUTOR\n    DONE\n> WEAR ALL\n    DOALL CARRIED\n> WEAR _\n    AUTOW\n    DONE\n> LOOK _\n    RESTART\n> EXAMI _\n    MESSAGE \"I see nothing special.\"\n    DONE\n> SCORE _\n    MES \"You have \"\n    PRINT fScore\n    MESSAGE \" points.\"\n    DONE\n> TURNS _\n    MES \"You have typed \"\n    DPRINT fTurns\n    MESSAGE \" commands.\"\n    DONE\n> QUIT _\n    QUIT\n    END\n> QUIT _\n    DONE\n> SAVE _\n    SAVE 0\n    RESTART\n> LOAD _\n    LOAD 0\n    RESTART\n> RAMSA _\n    RAMSAVE\n    MESSAGE \"Game saved in memory.\"\n    DONE\n> RAMLO _\n    RAMLOAD 255\n    RESTART\n"},{"id":"init","source":"; Game setup: windows, title screen and starting state.\n> _ _\n    WINDOW 1\n    WINAT 12 0             ; text from line 12 down\n    WINSIZE 12 42\n    CLS\n    DESC intro             ; the title screen\n    ANYKEY\n    CLS\n    SET 255\n> _ _\n    MINUS 255 1            ; clear every flag except 29\n    NOTEQ 255 fGFlags\n    CLEAR @255\n> _ _\n    NOTZERO 255\n    SKIP -2\n> _ _\n    RESET                  ; objects back to where they start\n    LET fStrength 10\n    LET fMaxCarr 4\n    SET fCPronounNoun\n    SET fCPronounAdject\n    GOTO start             ; first location of the game\n"}],"pictures":[{"id":"dib_entrada","zx":{"cx":0,"cy":0,"cw":32,"ch":12,"pixels":"","attrs":""}},{"id":"dib_pasillo","zx":{"cx":0,"cy":0,"cw":32,"ch":12,"pixels":"","attrs":""}}]}